# Photography App

A full-stack photography booking platform built with React + Vite on the frontend and Django REST Framework on the backend.

## Overview

This project includes:
- user registration and login
- photo and album management
- order creation and tracking
- email-based contact workflow
- JWT-based authentication

## Tech stack

Frontend:
- React 19
- TypeScript
- Vite
- Tailwind CSS
- React Router

Backend:
- Python 3.13+
- Django 6
- Django REST Framework
- PostgreSQL
- SimpleJWT

## Quick start

### 1) Clone and enter the project

```bash
git clone <repository-url>
cd photography-app-react
```

### 2) Start the database

```bash
cd backend
docker compose up -d
```

### 3) Install backend dependencies

```bash
cd backend
uv sync
```

### 4) Run database migrations

```bash
cd backend
uv run python manage.py migrate
```

### 5) Start the backend

```bash
cd backend
uv run python manage.py runserver 0.0.0.0:8000
```

### 6) Install frontend dependencies

```bash
cd frontend
npm install
```

### 7) Start the frontend

```bash
cd frontend
npm run dev
```

The frontend will run at http://localhost:5173 and the backend at http://127.0.0.1:8000.

